| S49 | any `js_push*` | `top + 1 >= JS_STACKSIZE` (4096) | `"stack overflow"` |
| S50 | `js_remove` / `js_insert` / `js_replace` / `js_copy` | `idx` outside `[BOT-TOP)` | `"stack error!"` / `"stack underflow!"` |
| S51 | `js_pop` | `n > gettop()` | `"stack underflow!"` |
