| S54 | `js_toregexp` | value is not a RegExp | `TypeError: not a regexp` |
| S55 | `js_getlength` | `this` not coercible | `TypeError` |
| S56 | `js_nextiterator` | iterator exhausted | returns `NULL` |
| S57 | `js_ref` | — | returns a stable ref string; `js_unref` with an unknown ref is a no-op |

